do GameManager.lock_player()
do CutSceneManager.start_cutscene()
ShopMan: Not bad for your first run, kid.
ShopMan: I hate to admit this, but being an exterminator is not all sunshine and rainbows. It's not all glory as one might think.
ShopMan: There's a... less desirable part folks don't really mention, and that is cleaning up after the Vermin. Yes, it's not the more desirable part of the job, but it must be done.
ShopMan: but hey there's a very very bright side to this! LUCRATIVE! You'll get the opportunity to earn some extra cash.
ShopMan: Destroy those 'Mounds' that have been popping up over town, and bring those green crystals to me! They ain't toxic I swear.. You can trade them for weapon upgrades.. it's the right of passage every rookie Exterminator has to go through!
ShopMan: Hurry! Go before time runs out!
[wait time="1.0"]
do CutSceneManager.end_cutscene()
do GameManager.unlock_player()
[wait time="1.2"]
do CutSceneManager.start_hunt_countdown()